# EXP-37: FP-Growth Rule Generation (Grocery Purchases Dataset) in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 37: FP-GROWTH RULE MINING IN WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To apply FP-Growth algorithm in WEKA on grocery transactions under 
   min_support = 50% (3 items) and min_confidence = 75%.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (grocery_exp37.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation grocery_purchases

@attribute Bread {f, t}
@attribute Cheese {f, t}
@attribute Egg {f, t}
@attribute Juice {f, t}
@attribute Milk {f, t}
@attribute Yogurt {f, t}

@data
t, t, t, t, f, f
t, t, f, t, f, f
t, f, f, f, t, t
t, f, f, t, t, f
f, t, f, t, t, f
----------------------------------------------------------------------

3. WEKA FP-GROWTH OUTPUT:
======================================================================
Scheme: weka.associations.FPGrowth -N 10 -C 0.75 -M 0.5
Instances: 5

FP-Tree Ordered Items: Juice (4) > Bread (4) > Cheese (3) > Milk (3)

Best Rules Found:
 1. Cheese=t ==> Juice=t   <conf:(1.00)> lift:(1.25)
 2. Milk=t ==> Juice=t     <conf:(0.67)> lift:(0.83)
 3. Juice=t ==> Bread=t    <conf:(0.75)> lift:(0.94)
======================================================================
